        "created_at": "2013-03-14T20:50:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've been playing that he heals first. The destruction effect resolves before the safe house effect becuase it's on Spite's character card which was in play before Safe House. My understanding of the timing rules is that the responses will resolve first, and then you get to do the Safe House's damage.</p><p>Either way, you're probably going to win though if he's that low when he flips. :D</p>",
